@description EA Native Automation
@version 2.2.15
@author Ebin Augustin
@about
  Compact Pro Tools-inspired automation panel for REAPER audio post-production.
  Windows x64 and macOS Intel/Apple Silicon universal native extensions with a matching Lua engine.
  Restart REAPER after installation. Run EA: Native Automation (JUCE) - toggle panel.
  Search EA: Automation for 104 individual shortcut actions.
  Preview/Capture, Manual Write, Write on Stop, Copy Send 1-10, copy/paste/fill, fixed-size docking and saved section visibility.
  The entire Preview button blinks green while active. REAPER theme colours and Inter fonts when available.
  Mac is a preview: compiled and model/installer checked; live REAPER Mac testing remains pending.
  Known track volume/pan Manual Write and envelope-visibility reports remain open. Linux source only.
  AGPL-3.0-or-later. Complete corresponding source and pinned dependency archives are linked below.
