@changelog
  Windows x64 and universal macOS Intel/Apple Silicon native packages; restart REAPER after updating.
  104 shortcut actions, separate Copy Send 1-10 and saved Show sections choices.
  Fixed-size docking flow and exact compact size presets; clearer Inter font rendering when available.
  Whole Preview button blinks green; Preview off makes every track/Master Read with no global override.
  Preserve automatic-envelope creation preference. Known volume/pan Manual Write and lane visibility reports remain open.
